    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40674" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπι-πτύσσω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fold up, fold</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γραμματεῖον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Dem.Enc.</u>
					25
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱμάτιον περὶ τὰς ῥῖνας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Isid.</u>
					131
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i>produce folds</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				11.508
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be folded</i>
			<i>over</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				6.8.28
			</span></i>; of the epiglottis, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ἐπὶ τὸ τῆς ἀρτηρίας τρῆμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					495a28
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PA</u>
				664b28
			</span></i>; of the vocal cords, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>UP</u>
				7.13
			</span></i>.</div>
